From 5eee6b515e010d8e25e810527771aa90f32131f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ravikant Cherukuri <ravi@openloopagentics.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 01:38:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/18] Bars widget: draw an SVG mark above the account tag

A two-letter tag spends the button's width on characters. Add a Logo key that
resolves through the same icon search the daemon already uses, and draw that
mark above the remaining tag letter -- a provider is recognisable as a shape
far faster than as a letter.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0196XW9vTfjGeWDpHTAmYsws
---
 src/config.rs |  1 +
 src/main.rs   |  1 +
 src/widget.rs | 52 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

